•	Rolling mean/std/min/max (leak-safe)
•	Expanding window features
•	Trend features
•	Seasonal indicators
•	Holiday distance features
•	Promotion recency features
•	Price elasticity proxies
•	Stockout flags
•	Event countdown features
🚨 Titanic trap avoided: Groupby without time guards.
